d at 10 am on friday the 23rd  of october  at 2020.  in those circumstances that is the um  confirmation of the decision by the  licensing subcommittee  agreed okay yeah thank you david for  that and i think that's  that's it for everybody thank you all  for turning up this morning  thank you thank you  you

